                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "015548b1-ff56-308f-a971-115645e89a53",
                        "entry_id": "37ebfc22-bb0e-3ecc-be42-d48898f2f485",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een gedachte die zich op een hinderlijke manier steeds opdringt en die je dus niet kunt onderdrukken"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab2fcbc8-1c17-4989-b6a5-a2c1fd4dceeb",
                                "sense_id": "015548b1-ff56-308f-a971-115645e89a53",
                                "text": "Ik heb frequent last van een dwanggedachte over prachtige vrouwen en mensen die ik hoog acht: dat ook zij naar het toilet moeten. Zelfs voor een grote boodschap, meneer. Dat vind ik heel zwaar in mijn leven."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aa5c8b93-1127-4c75-8f48-18c9a51f3571",
                                "sense_id": "015548b1-ff56-308f-a971-115645e89a53",
                                "text": "Zo was er een meisje dat zó’n minderwaardigheidscomplex had. Ze liet thuis geen vingerafdruk achter, omdat ze vond dat ze er niet mocht zijn. Ander voorbeeld: Ik kon een jongen helpen met muziek, mijn grote passie. Ik hielp door met muziek hem af te leiden van zijn dwanggedachtes.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7b2b79cc-9324-4ff2-a50b-7d9b043d9af1",
                        "source_entry_id": "37ebfc22-bb0e-3ecc-be42-d48898f2f485",
                        "source_sense_id": "015548b1-ff56-308f-a971-115645e89a53",
                        "target_lang_word": "hang-up",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hang-up",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a09ae916-de72-37cc-af7c-fb73bd463c8e",
                                        "entry_id": "15ad5952-7bfb-3efa-ba0a-7f28da44f22f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An emotional difficulty or a psychological inhibition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a84bcf1-bf38-4e53-a9e2-2c212c8b1463",
                                                "sense_id": "a09ae916-de72-37cc-af7c-fb73bd463c8e",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: neurosis, obsession, complex"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ec7c9ee-7869-4b12-9d22-501261d3754b",
                                                "sense_id": "a09ae916-de72-37cc-af7c-fb73bd463c8e",
                                                "text": "We’re said to have so many hang-ups that we don’t even talk about sex until we’re in the pub, and to need to be blind drunk before anything approaching physical contact occurs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d95a4b1-908f-46f3-8f0e-d196a4f812bc",
                                                "sense_id": "a09ae916-de72-37cc-af7c-fb73bd463c8e",
                                                "text": "I have hang-ups left over from childhood about my body. My wife sometimes reminds me that, instead of saying, “I want to be thin”, I could say, “I want to be happy”, which is profoundly good advice."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1532d92a-845c-4038-aae1-78b2fc49cddc",
                                                "sense_id": "a09ae916-de72-37cc-af7c-fb73bd463c8e",
                                                "text": "As if the overpowering sense of grief wasn’t enough, Munch’s art unashamedly confesses to massive sexual hangups."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c8b0e7f-6ec8-429b-b78b-480832365481",
                                                "sense_id": "a09ae916-de72-37cc-af7c-fb73bd463c8e",
                                                "text": "How can I help my partner get over his hangups? Letting him have sex with other men isn’t working [title]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05aec8f4-c87f-3cd6-b8db-264e09b5dd44",
                                        "entry_id": "15ad5952-7bfb-3efa-ba0a-7f28da44f22f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An unforeseen obstacle to progress; a hitch or delay."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "612583b1-854a-477a-a593-a99bd33ae232",
                                                "sense_id": "05aec8f4-c87f-3cd6-b8db-264e09b5dd44",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: setback"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b9b1202-7c5a-494d-bdf3-81ad1d974ed4",
                                                "sense_id": "05aec8f4-c87f-3cd6-b8db-264e09b5dd44",
                                                "text": "What a hang up I got into at once! As I look back on it it's incredible that I could have been so damned dumb."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7e0999f-7966-4171-99f3-a607a866a03d",
                                                "sense_id": "05aec8f4-c87f-3cd6-b8db-264e09b5dd44",
                                                "text": "Consumers say yes, the numbers add up, industry is largely on board and Labor has no policy hang-ups. This week could be the turning point[.]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6b8b5156-7336-45f0-8491-ffc6203d2594",
                        "source_entry_id": "37ebfc22-bb0e-3ecc-be42-d48898f2f485",
                        "source_sense_id": "015548b1-ff56-308f-a971-115645e89a53",
